{"kind":"propose","text":"PROPOSAL: adopt the decision recorded at notes/2026-08-27-lane-identity.md at commit 6131249c6a6f86cbd8893bf30f2d582f88bbb274 (artifact 953c3746). Lane identity is anchored in content-addressed facts — the Rests-On commit-trailer reverse index, worktree-local gitseq.request config stamped by a gs worktree verb, deterministic refs/gitseq/lanes/\u003crequest-hash\u003e refs — with validated body.branch/body.worktree for display only; merge receipts and request retirements then compute the checkout that has become removable. This refines and sharpens items 5 and 6 of the standing audit-remediation proposal c781f3f5; the sequencing kernel learns nothing about git. For ratification by hugh. On ratification, planner files the implementation requests; the note's own head then proceeds to independent review and merge per the notes flow."}